WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
Damn, I'm freezing.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.547
Oh, that's warm.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.674
Oh, the hero's back!

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.970
Heard you fired off your gun!

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.888
-Here comes the hotshot!
-Hey!

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.226
-I don't want to hear it.
-You took equipment again.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.729
-Coming back from a triathlon?
-I won!

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.523
You're the laughing stock of the station.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.028
--doesn't mean it's okay!

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.948
You're not supposed to fire your gun
without clearance.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.743
That's enough already.
Why are you on my case--?

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:39.456
-What I'm saying is--
-I can't hear you because of the water.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.167
And the GPS round you fired

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.170
-is something I developed.
-Oh, James.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.173
-People will think I had a part in it.
-You got to a sauna?

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:50.175
It worked out, so what's the problem?

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.760
No, it didn't.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.475
-I'm telling you this for your own sake.
-Keep it to yourself.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.477
What are you doing after this?

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:04.647
I'm going to get my things and go home
before he finds me.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.192
Before he finds you? What are you--?

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:12.489
Welcome back.

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:16.159
You should've left before he found you.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:38.098
When asked about the bribery allegations
made against LIVE Corporation,

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:43.394
the company's chairman, Steven Martland,
stated that the reports are baseless--

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.815
Did you not know?

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.068
You're not supposed to hurt
material witnesses.

00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:53.154
I think you saw
that I had no other choice--

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:55.323
Why did you fire your gun
without permission?

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.327
I always tell you not to jump the gun.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.330
-But I had no choice in that situation--
-Also...

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:07.627
You had a choice when you took equipment
from the station without the paperwork.

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:11.631
-James, how many years have you been here?
-Seven years.

00:02:12.006 --> 00:02:14.092
Yes, it will be eight years.

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:18.263
You should know what kind of organization
we're running here by now.

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:23.017
This is a police organization

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:26.354
responsible for
maintaining peace and order in society.

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.858
And we are the bureau in charge
of the dangerous cases

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:33.820
-which require careful countermeasures.
-Which require careful countermeasures.

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:36.156
That is our job at the SSC.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:44.747
Everyone here recognizes your abilities.
Your clearance rate is off the charts.

00:02:45.874 --> 00:02:49.043
It brings me pride as a fellow SSC member.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.129
-Thank you, sir.
-However!

00:02:53.256 --> 00:02:55.842
Reckless actions puts others in danger.

00:02:56.426 --> 00:03:00.180
I called you in here because I'd like you
to do something about that.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.852
The SSC is an organization in which
you are an individual member.

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:07.687
Yes, sir...

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:13.693
Here's the paperwork.
You get to fill it out.

